#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of vsftpd"
msgstr "Instalação do vsftpd"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For security reasons, running <application>vsftpd</application> as an "
"unprivileged user and group is encouraged. Also, a user should be created to"
" map anonymous users. As the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, create the needed directories, "
"users, and groups with the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Por motivos de segurança, executar o "
"&quot;<application>vsftpd</application>&quot; como um(a) usuário(a) e grupo "
"sem privilégios é encorajado. Além disso, um(a) usuário(a) deveria ser "
"criado(a) para mapear usuários(as) anônimos(as). Como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;, crie os "
"diretórios, usuários(as) e grupos necessários(as) com os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:101
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -d -m 0755 &vsftpd-empty; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -d -m 0755 /home/ftp               &amp;&amp;\n"
"groupadd -g 47 vsftpd                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"groupadd -g 45 ftp                            &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"useradd -c \"vsftpd User\"  -d /dev/null -g vsftpd -s /bin/false -u 47 vsftpd &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c anonymous_user -d /home/ftp -g ftp    -s /bin/false -u 45 ftp</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -d -m 0755 &vsftpd-empty; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -d -m 0755 /home/ftp               &amp;&amp;\n"
"groupadd -g 47 vsftpd                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"groupadd -g 45 ftp                            &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"useradd -c \"Usuário(a) vsftpd\"  -d /dev/null -g vsftpd -s /bin/false -u 47 vsftpd &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c anonymous_user -d /home/ftp -g ftp    -s /bin/false -u 45 ftp</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Gcc-10 and later flags an error for an implicit type cast. Make it explicit:"
msgstr ""
"O &quot;Gcc-10&quot; e posteriores sinalizam um erro para uma conversão "
"implícita de tipo. Torne isso explícito:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:114
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"s/kVSFSysStrOpenUnknown;/(enum "
"EVSFSysUtilOpenMode)&amp;/\" -i sysstr.c</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"s/kVSFSysStrOpenUnknown;/(enum "
"EVSFSysUtilOpenMode)&amp;/\" -i sysstr.c</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Build <application>vsftpd</application> as an unprivileged user using the "
"following command:"
msgstr ""
"Construa o &quot;<application>vsftpd</application>&quot; como um(a) "
"usuário(a) sem privilégios usando o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:128
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Once again, become the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user"
" and install <application>vsftpd</application> with the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Mais uma vez, torne-se o usuário &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot; e instale o "
"&quot;<application>vsftpd</application>&quot; com os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:133
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m 755 vsftpd        /usr/sbin/vsftpd    &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m 644 vsftpd.8      /usr/share/man/man8 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m 644 vsftpd.conf.5 /usr/share/man/man5 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m 644 vsftpd.conf   /etc</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m 755 vsftpd        /usr/sbin/vsftpd    &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m 644 vsftpd.8     /usr/share/man/man8 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m 644 vsftpd.conf.5 /usr/share/man/man5 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m 644 vsftpd.conf   /etc</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install -v -d ...</command>: This creates the directory that "
"anonymous users will use (<filename class='directory'>/home/ftp</filename>)"
"  and the directory the daemon will chroot into (<filename "
"class='directory'>&vsftpd-empty;</filename>)."
msgstr ""
"<command>install -v -d ...</command>: Isso cria o diretório que os(as) "
"usuários(as) anônimos(as) usarão (&quot;<filename "
"class='directory'>/home/ftp</filename>&quot;) e o diretório que o processo "
"de segundo plano se enjaulará nele (&quot;<filename "
"class='directory'>&vsftpd-empty;</filename>&quot;)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">/home/ftp</filename> should not be owned by "
"the user <systemitem class=\"username\">vsftpd</systemitem>, or the user "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">ftp</systemitem>."
msgstr ""
"&quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/home/ftp</filename>&quot; não deveria "
"ser titularizado pelo(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">vsftpd</systemitem>&quot;, ou pelo(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">ftp</systemitem>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>echo \"#define VSF_BUILD_TCPWRAPPERS\" >>builddefs.h</command>: Use"
" this prior to <command>make</command> to add support for "
"<application>tcpwrappers</application>."
msgstr ""
"<command>echo \"#define VSF_BUILD_TCPWRAPPERS\" >>builddefs.h</command>: Use"
" isso antes do &quot;<command>make</command>&quot; para adicionar suporte a "
"&quot;<application>tcpwrappers</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>echo \"#define VSF_BUILD_SSL\" >>builddefs.h</command>: Use this "
"prior to <command>make</command> to add support for SSL."
msgstr ""
"<command>echo \"#define VSF_BUILD_SSL\" >>builddefs.h</command>: Use isso "
"antes do &quot;<command>make</command>&quot; para adicionar suporte a "
"&quot;SSL&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:171
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install -v -m ...</command>: The <filename>Makefile</filename> uses"
" non-standard installation paths.  These commands install the files in "
"<filename class='directory'>/usr</filename> and <filename "
"class='directory'>/etc</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<command>install -v -m ...</command>: O <filename>Makefile</filename> usa "
"caminhos de instalação não padrões. Esses comandos instalam os arquivos em "
"&quot;<filename class='directory'>/usr</filename>&quot; e &quot;<filename "
"class='directory'>/etc</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:181
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring vsftpd"
msgstr "Configurando vsftpd"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:184
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:187
#, xml-text
msgid "<filename>/etc/vsftpd.conf</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>/etc/vsftpd.conf</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/vsftpd.conf"
msgstr "/etc/vsftpd.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:197
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:200
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>vsftpd</application> comes with a basic anonymous-only "
"configuration file that was copied to <filename "
"class='directory'>/etc</filename> above. While still as <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, this file should be modified because "
"it is now recommended to run <command>vsftpd</command> in standalone mode. "
"Also, you should specify the privilege separation user created above. "
"Finally, you should specify the <command>chroot</command> directory.  "
"<command>man vsftpd.conf</command> will give you all the details."
msgstr ""
"O &quot;<application>vsftpd</application>&quot; vem com um arquivo básico de"
" configuração somente anônimo que foi copiado para &quot;<filename "
"class='directory'>/etc</filename>&quot; acima. Embora ainda como "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;, esse arquivo "
"deveria ser modificado porque agora é recomendado executar o "
"&quot;<command>vsftpd</command>&quot; em modo autônomo. Além disso, você "
"deveria especificar o(a) usuário(a) de separação de privilégios criado(a) "
"acima. Finalmente, você deveria especificar o diretório "
"&quot;<command>chroot</command>&quot;. &quot;<command>man "
"vsftpd.conf</command>&quot; te dará todos os detalhes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:211
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/vsftpd.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>background=YES\n"
"nopriv_user=vsftpd\n"
"secure_chroot_dir=&vsftpd-empty;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/vsftpd.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>background=YES\n"
"nopriv_user=vsftpd\n"
"secure_chroot_dir=&vsftpd-empty;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To enable local logins, append the following to the "
"<filename>/etc/vsftpd.conf</filename> file (as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user):"
msgstr ""
"Para habilitar &quot;logins&quot; locais, anexe o seguinte ao arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/vsftpd.conf</filename>&quot; (como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:240
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/vsftpd.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>local_enable=YES</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/vsftpd.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>local_enable=YES</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In addition, if using <application>Linux-PAM</application> and "
"<application>vsftpd</application> with local user logins, you will need a "
"<application>Linux-PAM</application> configuration file. As the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, create the "
"<filename>/etc/pam.d/vsftpd</filename> file, and add the needed "
"configuration changes for <application>Linux-PAM</application> session "
"support using the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Além disso, se usar o &quot;<application>Linux-PAM</application>&quot; e o "
"&quot;<application>vsftpd</application>&quot; com &quot;logins&quot; locais "
"de usuário(a), [então] você precisará de um arquivo de configuração do "
"&quot;<application>Linux-PAM</application>&quot;. Como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;, crie o arquivo"
" &quot;<filename>/etc/pam.d/vsftpd</filename>&quot; e adicione as mudanças "
"necessárias de configuração para o suporte da sessão do "
"&quot;<application>Linux-PAM</application>&quot; usando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:254
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/vsftpd &lt;&lt; \"EOF\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/vsftpd\n"
"auth       required     /lib/security/pam_listfile.so item=user sense=deny \\\n"
"                                                      file=/etc/ftpusers \\\n"
"                                                      onerr=succeed\n"
"auth       required     pam_shells.so\n"
"auth       include      system-auth\n"
"account    include      system-account\n"
"session    include      system-session</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /etc/vsftpd.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>session_support=YES\n"
"pam_service_name=vsftpd</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/vsftpd &lt;&lt; \"EOF\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/pam.d/vsftpd\n"
"auth       required     /lib/security/pam_listfile.so item=user sense=deny \\\n"
"                                                      file=/etc/ftpusers \\\n"
"                                                      onerr=succeed\n"
"auth       required     pam_shells.so\n"
"auth       include      system-auth\n"
"account    include      system-account\n"
"session    include      system-session</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /etc/vsftpd.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>session_support=YES\n"
"pam_service_name=vsftpd</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/vsftpd.xml:273
